title: The Reichstag Election
subtitle: The Weimar coalition loses its majority.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1920 and month = 6 and crisis = 0 and ending_id = 0 and e20_election_done = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
Q.e20_election_done = 1;
var s = {spd: 102, uspd: 84, ddp: 39, zentrum: 64, bvp: 21, dvp: 65, dnvp: 71, nsdap: 0, kapd: 0};
var kpd = 0;
if (!Q.election_boycott) {
    // the elections engine (sys_lib): our share from support, members,
    // unity, repression and relations, around the historical 2.1 per cent
    var bonus = (Q.kapp_outcome == 3 ? 1.5 : 0) + (Q.ruhr_red_army == 2 ? 1 : 0) + (Q.kapp_statement == 1 ? -0.5 : 0) + (Q.works_councils_line == 1 ? 0.5 : 0);
    var res = RG.election('reichstag', {base: {spd: 102, uspd: 84, ddp: 39, zentrum: 64, bvp: 21, dvp: 65, dnvp: 71, kpd: 4},
        size: 459, kpdShare: 2.1, bonus: bonus, apply: false});
    kpd = res.kpd_seats;
    kpd = Math.max(1, Math.min(30, kpd));
}
s.uspd -= (kpd - 4);
if (Q.kapp_outcome == 3) {
    // the victory over Kapp carries the workers' parties; how far depends on our standing
    var shift = Math.max(20, Math.min(50, Math.round(35 + (Q.worker_support - 25) / 2)));
    var to_spd = Math.round(shift * 0.6);
    s.spd += to_spd; s.uspd += shift - to_spd;
    var from_dnvp = Math.round(shift * 0.4), from_dvp = Math.round(shift * 0.35), from_ddp = Math.round(shift * 0.15);
    s.dnvp -= from_dnvp; s.dvp -= from_dvp; s.ddp -= from_ddp; s.zentrum -= shift - from_dnvp - from_dvp - from_ddp;
} else if (Q.kapp_outcome == 2) {
    s.spd += 8; s.uspd += 7; s.dnvp -= 10; s.dvp -= 5;
}
if (Q.ruhr_red_army == 2) {
    s.dnvp += 4; s.dvp += 3; s.spd -= 4; s.ddp -= 3;
}
for (var p in s) {
    Q[p + '_seats'] = s[p];
}
Q.kpd_seats = kpd;
Q.parliament_name = 'Reichstag';
Q.parliament_size = 459;
Q.e20_kpd_seats_display = kpd;
// the government after the election
Q.e20_wg_survives = 0;
if (Q.kapp_outcome == 3) {
    var left = s.spd + s.uspd + ((Q.wg_stance == 1 || Q.wg_stance == 2) ? kpd : 0);
    if (left >= 230) {
        Q.e20_wg_survives = 1;
    }
}
for (var p of Q.parties) {
    Q[p + '_in_government'] = 0;
}
if (Q.e20_wg_survives) {
    Q.spd_in_government = 1;
    Q.uspd_in_government = 1;
    Q.chancellor = 'Carl Legien';
    Q.government_name = Q.kpd_in_government ? 'Workers\' government (SPD, USPD, KPD)' : 'Workers\' government (SPD, USPD)';
} else {
    Q.zentrum_in_government = 1;
    Q.ddp_in_government = 1;
    Q.dvp_in_government = 1;
    Q.chancellor = 'Constantin Fehrenbach';
    Q.government_name = 'Fehrenbach cabinet (Centre, DDP, DVP)';
    Q.kpd_in_government = 0;
    Q.stability += 3;
}
!}

= The Reichstag Election

The parties of the Weimar coalition, which held three quarters of the National Assembly, have lost their majority. The SPD wins [+ spd_seats +] seats and the USPD [+ uspd_seats +]. The DNVP wins [+ dnvp_seats +] and Stresemann's DVP [+ dvp_seats +]. The Centre has [+ zentrum_seats +].

[? if election_boycott = 0 : Our party wins [+ e20_kpd_seats_display +] seats. ?][? if election_boycott = 1 : We stood no candidates, and the workers who would have voted for us voted for the Independents. ?] [? if e20_wg_survives = 1 : The workers' parties have a majority if the communists are counted, and Legien stays in the Chancellery. ?][? if e20_wg_survives = 0 : On 25 June the Centre's Constantin Fehrenbach forms a cabinet of the Centre, the Democrats and the DVP, the party of heavy industry. ?]

- @work: Our deputies will do serious work in the Reichstag.
- @bloc: Propose a workers' bloc in the Reichstag to the SPD and the USPD.
- @abstention: Claim the abstentions as ours.
- @mistake: Admit that the boycott was a mistake.

@work
subtitle: Bills, inquiries and speeches printed in full at the factory gates.
view-if: election_boycott = 0
on-arrival: worker_support += 2; lean_luxemburgist += 1

Our deputies take their seats on the far left of the chamber. Their first speech is on the dead of the Ruhr.

@bloc
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The SPD will say it will consider it.
view-if: election_boycott = 0
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.uspd_relation += 6;
Q.uspd_score += 1;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

The USPD's deputies agree to vote with us against every measure the cabinet brings against labour. The SPD does not answer.

@abstention
subtitle: The Left Radicals will be pleased. Nobody else will believe it.
view-if: election_boycott = 1
on-arrival: ultraleft_satisfaction += 5; worker_support -= 2

Our press reports that a fifth of the electorate stayed at home. It does not say that most of them were never ours.

@mistake
subtitle: The Left Radicals will be angry.
view-if: election_boycott = 1
on-arrival: election_boycott = 0; ultraleft_satisfaction -= 10; lean_luxemburgist += 1

The Zentrale's circular says the boycott left the Reichstag to our enemies and our voters to the USPD.
